OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after woman's
OL,4,Abody found
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have launched a murder
OL,7,Finvestigation after a woman was found
OL,8,Fdead at a property in Norfolk.
OL,10,FOfficers found the body of a woman in
OL,11,Fher 40s at an address in Fern Hill,
OL,12,FDersingham, in the early hours of
OL,13,FSunday, Norfolk Police said.
OL,15,FOfficers were called to the house by
OL,16,Fthe ambulance service shortly after
OL,17,F02:20 BST.
OL,19,FA man in his 40s was arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of murder and taken to King's
OL,21,FLynn Police Investigation Centre for
OL,22,Fquestioning, the force added.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
